                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-3" marker="3">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	The number of hours of a recognised participation type for an individual to be counted towards the increased hours result may be affected by Minister’s rules made for the purposes of subclause (4), or a Secretary’s determination made under subclause (5).</p>
                    </content>
                  </authorialNote>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-36__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>The increased hours result applies to an individual for a CCS fortnight if the individual engages in more than 48 hours of a recognised participation type in the CCS fortnight.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
